WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.079
Copy trading follows another trader's wallet.

00:00:03.079 --> 00:00:06.657
When they buy a coin, the app buys it too, with your money.

00:00:06.657 --> 00:00:08.174
When they sell, you sell.

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:11.085
It starts on paper, with fake money, on purpose.

00:00:11.085 --> 00:00:16.604
Our own numbers say copying loses money on most wallets, so treat it as a test, not a plan.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:20.848
Start on the Hub, the home screen with the big tiles.

00:00:20.848 --> 00:00:21.810
Click Automation.

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:26.448
Then click Copy Simple, at the top of the menu on the left.

00:00:26.448 --> 00:00:28.458
It is the easy way to copy someone.

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:33.023
Paste the wallet address of the trader you want to follow.

00:00:33.023 --> 00:00:36.051
We blurred ours, so nobody copies it from this video.

00:00:36.051 --> 00:00:37.365
Not sure who to follow?

00:00:37.365 --> 00:00:39.764
Click the Wallet Scout link under the box.

00:00:39.764 --> 00:00:42.563
It ranks wallets by how a copier would have done.

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:46.399
If you like, give it a name you will remember.

00:00:46.399 --> 00:00:47.638
This part is optional.

00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:51.859
Now pick how much SOL to spend each time they buy.

00:00:51.859 --> 00:00:53.285
Start with the smallest.

00:00:53.285 --> 00:00:58.154
If it loses ten times that amount in one day, it stops copying until the next day.

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:00.710
Click Follow on paper.

00:01:00.710 --> 00:01:02.021
Nothing real is spent.

00:01:02.021 --> 00:01:08.095
The app pretends to copy every trade, with the fees included, so you can see what would have happened.

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:11.936
Your follow shows up here, under Your follows.

00:01:11.936 --> 00:01:14.971
Leave it running for a few days, and watch the record.

00:01:14.971 --> 00:01:17.894
It shows what copying them would have made, or lost.

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:22.808
Only if that record convinces you, switch the card to Live.

00:01:22.808 --> 00:01:26.290
Then it spends real SOL by itself, even while you sleep.

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:32.410
Want more control, like filters, a delay, or a different size for each trade?

00:01:32.410 --> 00:01:33.675
Click Every control.

00:01:33.675 --> 00:01:35.953
It opens the full Copy Trading page.

00:01:35.953 --> 00:01:37.597
Most people never need it.

00:01:38.850 --> 00:01:39.550
That is it.

00:01:39.550 --> 00:01:42.861
Paste a wallet, pick an amount, and follow on paper.

00:01:42.861 --> 00:01:45.217
Watch the record for days, not hours.

00:01:45.217 --> 00:01:50.311
Remember, copying copies their losses too, and Live spends real money by itself.
